# client verbs beside `GetFramerate`. Stock seat: TWoW's FrameXML.toc l.52, right between
# ItemButtonTemplate.xml above and SpellBookFrame.xml below, the same seat stock 1.12's own
# toc gives it. Nothing else references the frame — `ToggleStats` is the file's own global, so
# a chain that does not carry the file loses only the frame, never a dependency.
